      d(x,y)/d(t,pi) = det[[-t^-2, 0],[w' + pi delta t^{delta-1}, t^delta]] = -t^{delta-2},
so    F_t G_pi - F_pi G_t  =  -c t^{delta-2}.                                   (LOCAL-KELLER)
