> `σ_1 ∈ K_1 := C((x^{-1/L_1}))`. Write `δ_1 = p/q` in lowest terms; then
> `lcm(L_1,q) = L_1Δ_1` and `Gal(C((x^{-1/L_1Δ_1}))/K_1)` is cyclic of order `Δ_1`,
