+  (x+y^5,y+(x+y^5)^3) recover f exactly and satisfy DEG/POLY/NO-RESIDUE.
+  The composition has five bottom discs, three branches each.
+  g=y^2-x^2-x fails at [x^-1](1/g_y)=+/-1/2, t-order 1.
+
+NOT CLAIMED
